<title>GHANA: Trade lifeless on Ghana Stock Exchange.</title>
<headline>Trade lifeless on Ghana Stock Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>No share prices moved in trading on the Ghana Stock Exchange on Wednesday so the bourse index closed unchanged, the market report showed.</p>
<p>A total of 37,530 shares changed hands.</p>
<p>The All-Share index closed at 384.82, the same as Monday, the last day of trading.</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
